M05_Escapee_Brother (100038, secondary 509 plus the Personal Ion Cannon
reward, invaders and visceroid) and M05_Babushka (100050, secondary 510)
start the non-key conversations M05_CON022/M05_CON023 (both action 300509)
before Monitor_Conversation, and act only on ENDED. A start refused by a
playing key conversation (M05_CON038/M05_CON008 are the radio briefings
of these two objectives) stops with INTERRUPTED before any monitor
exists, and an INTERRUPTED end (player left the range, orator lost) was
ignored. Either way poke_id was 2 and conversation stayed true, so the
character could never be poked again and the objective stayed pending
(retail behaviour).

Set the poke state and the monitor before starting, and re-arm the poke
on an INTERRUPTED or UNABLE_TO_INIT end of 300509. Babushka re-arms to a
new case 3 that replays only the thanks conversation; her first-poke
animation, Action_Reset and team change still run once. The ENDED
handlers are guarded by the existing saved complete/saved flags, so 509/1
and 510/1 are sent exactly once. The ENDED path is otherwise unchanged.

